@page "/components/dropdown-menu"

<PageTitle>Dropdown Menu — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Dropdown Menu</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    Built on the popover API, which supplies the top layer, light dismiss and Escape. The panel is
    promoted out of the document flow, so it escapes any <code>overflow: hidden</code> it is
    written inside — that is the whole reason to use it rather than an absolutely positioned div.
</p>
<p class="doc-note">
    <code>popovertarget</code> opens it before any JavaScript has run, and keeps opening it if
    <code>ui.js</code> fails to load. The compiler only adds the positioning and the roving focus.
</p>

