<h2 class="doc-h2">Submenu</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    Right opens, Left closes, Escape closes the lot — the APG's keys, bound in
    <code>ui.js</code> because <code>[popover]</code> has no nesting of its own. The panel opens
    <i>beside</i> its row rather than below it, or it lands on top of the row you came from.
</p>
